<!doctype html>
<html>
<body>
<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="color: #4CAF50;">Energy Request Approved - WattsUp Energy</h1>
<p>Dear {{name}},</p>
<p>Congratulations! Your energy generation verification request for <strong>{{month}}/{{year}}</strong> has been <strong>approved</strong>.</p>
<p>The reward is now being generated on the blockchain. You will receive another notification once the reward has been successfully generated.</p>
{{#if note}}
<p><strong>Admin Notes:</strong></p>
<p style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px;">{{note}}</p>
{{/if}}
<p>You can check the status of your request by logging into your account.</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>WattsUp Energy Team</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>


